{
  "id": "JOB.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 24",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Why does the Almighty not set times for judgment?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Why must those who know him look in vain for such days?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There are those who move boundary stones;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they pasture flocks they have stolen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They drive away the orphan's donkey",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and take the widow's ox in pledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They thrust the needy from the path",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and force all the poor of the land into hiding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like wild donkeys in the desert,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the poor go about their labor of foraging food;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the wasteland provides food for their children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They gather fodder in the fields",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and glean in the vineyards of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacking clothes, they spend the night naked;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they have nothing to cover themselves in the cold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are drenched by mountain rains",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and hug the rocks for lack of shelter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fatherless child is snatched from the breast;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the infant of the poor is seized for a debt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacking clothes, they go about naked;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they carry the sheaves, but still go hungry.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They crush olives among the terraces",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they tread the winepresses, yet suffer thirst.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The groans of the dying rise from the city,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the souls of the wounded cry out for help.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But God charges no one with wrongdoing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"There are those who rebel against the light,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who do not know its ways",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or stay in its paths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When daylight is gone, the murderer rises up,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kills the poor and needy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and in the night steals forth like a thief.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eye of the adulterer watches for dusk;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he thinks, 'No eye will see me,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he keeps his face concealed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the dark, thieves break into houses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but by day they shut themselves in;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they want nothing to do with the light.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For all of them, midnight is their morning;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they make friends with the terrors of darkness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Yet they are foam on the surface of the water;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "their portion of the land is cursed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so that no one goes to the vineyards.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As heat and drought snatch away the melted snow,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so the grave snatches away those who have sinned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The womb forgets them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the worm feasts on them;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JOB 24:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the wicked are no longer remembered",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but are broken like a tree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They prey on the barren and childless woman,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and to the widow they show no kindness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God drags away the mighty by his power;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "though they become established, they have no assurance of life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He may let them rest in a feeling of security,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but his eyes are on their ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For a little while they are exalted, and then they are gone;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they are brought low and gathered up like all others;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they are cut off like heads of grain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If this is not so, who can prove me false",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 24:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and reduce my words to nothing?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
